Enables the onboard AP6611S (Synaptics SYN43711) WiFi on SDIO.
The overlay switches the SDIO controller to the sdiom0 pins.
It powers the module through an mmc-pwrseq-simple on WL_REG_ON (GPIO2_C5).
The 32.768 kHz LPO comes from the hym8563.
The "android,bcmdhd_wlan" node gives the driver its host-wake interrupt (GPIO0_B0).
Needs a bcmdhd-sdio-dkms release with the changes from https://github.com/armbian/bcmdhd-dkms/pull/15.
They enable CONFIG_BCMDHD_DTS and fix the Linux 7.3 build, duplicate cipher suites and firmware paths.
With 101.10.591.52.27-10 or older, the driver gets no host-wake interrupt and WiFi stays down.
